// Blender 5.2 EEVEE-SQ2 raster fallback — design patch (apply by hand, paths shift).
// Goal: EEVEE Material Preview that NEVER emits compute or typed-UAV, stays raster-only.
// This is NOT full EEVEE-Next. It's "EEVEE-SQ2": raster + pixel lighting, no ray/compute passes.
// Full speed on Adreno 690 because every remaining opcode already works via D3D11-proven path.
//
// Files to touch (v5.2 branch):
//  source/blender/draw/engines/eevee_next/eevee_shader_shared.hh
//  source/blender/draw/engines/eevee_next/eevee_pipeline.cc
//  source/blender/gpu/vulkan/vk_backend.cc
//  source/blender/gpu/opengl/gl_backend.cc (your frankenbuild patch site)
//
// 1. Add env flag: SQ2_EEVEE_RASTER=1
//    if (getenv("SQ2_EEVEE_RASTER")) { EEVEE_SQ2_RASTER = true; }
//
// 2. In eevee_pipeline.cc, when EEVEE_SQ2_RASTER:
//    - Disable: shadow compute, lightprobe compute, film compute, cryptomatte compute,
//      horizon scan, LUT generation via compute. Replace each with:
//      a) precomputed LUT texture (bake once on CPU at startup, upload as immutable),
//      b) pixel-shader fallback already in EEVEE for low-end (see EEVEE_LEGACY paths in 4.1).
//    - Force: forward raster, 1x MSAA off, no volumetrics compute, SSR off, SSS off.
//    - Keep: base PBR pixel lighting, image textures, alpha blend — all pixel-stage, all Gen2-safe.
//
// 3. In GPU backend checks (gl_backend.cc + vk_backend.cc):
//    - Change UNSUPPORTED -> LIMITED when SQ2_EEVEE_RASTER and renderer is Adreno 6xx.
//    - Vulkan: if VK_KHR_dynamic_rendering missing, fall back to vkBeginRenderPass path
//      (Mesa does this internally; copy that branch, don't invent).
//    - Vulkan: timelineSemaphore -> binary semaphore + vkWaitForFences (2% sync cost).
//
// 4. Shader rewriter hook (pairs with dxil_rewrite.py):
//    - In gpu_shader_create, if SQ2_EEVEE_RASTER, run GLSL string replace:
//      "gl_BaseInstance" -> "sq2_baseInstance", prepend "uniform int sq2_baseInstance;\n"
//      "imageLoad(" with float format -> "sq2_rawLoad(" (structured buffer version, same bytes).
//
// What you get:
//  WILL: Material Preview with lights/textures at Adreno speed, latest .blend IO intact.
//  WON'T: raytraced SSR, volumetrics, GPU subdiv compute, Cycles GPU. Those stay CPU/off.
//  That's still EEVEE lighting, not Workbench flat — and it's the most Gen2 can do without CPU pixels.
//
// Build: same as frankenbuild/BUILD_SQ2.md, but -DWITH_EEVEE_SQ2_RASTER=ON + SQ2_EEVEE_RASTER=1 at runtime.
// Test: blender.exe --factory-startup --gpu-backend OPENGL --debug-gpu + set SQ2_EEVEE_RASTER=1
//  Open Material Preview on default cube. Expect lit PBR, black only on volumetrics/SSR balls.
